Subject to this licence, GxP Blueprint grants You a worldwide, royalty-free,
non-exclusive, non-transferable right to access, download, copy, use, and
adapt the Material for Internal Use.

This permission applies to organizations of every size. In particular, a
large or multinational pharmaceutical company may use and adapt the Material
inside its own quality system and internal operations. There is no employee,
revenue, market-capitalization, or monthly-active-user threshold.

An employee or contractor may share the Material within the permitted
organization and its controlled affiliates where that sharing is necessary
for Internal Use. A contractor must use it only for the relevant internal
engagement and must not reuse or commercialize it independently.

